# Anchored on purpose: an unanchored "edh-stats" or "data/" also matches
# cmd/edh-stats and packaging/data, which silently hides real files from git -
# that is how a broken Dockerfile and an uncommitted packaging file happened.
/.idea
/edh-stats
/data
/.tools

# Private keys must never be committed: the deployment pipeline authenticates
# over SSH, and these files used to sit in the repository root without being
# ignored.
deploy_key*
*.key
*.pem
.env
